## Getting started

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate        # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env             # Windows: copy .env.example .env
```

## Run the app

```bash
python -m app.main
```

## Run the tests

```bash
pytest
```

## Next steps

- Add your model or data-processing code under `app/`.
